Structure: Dark, moody, lying down and staring composition, as it is intended to be used as a thumbnail for ASMR (book reading, whispered storytelling)\nClothing: We would be happy to write freely and cutely, such as loungewear.\n\nIf possible, we would be happy to have facial expression differences.\n\n\nCharm points are as follows\nHair: I would like the bangs to be a little sparse and not too short.\nColor: White mesh in the center and on the right side of the head, white inner color.\nMouth: On the left side, there is a small mole.\nOther: An asterisk somewhere in the middle would be nice.\nThe ears are bunny ears.\n\nI apologize for all the requests in the midst of your busy schedule.\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nURL https://chimonoheya.fanbox.cc/\n\nhttps://chimonoheya.fanbox.cc/manage/posts/4297135", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tkskmakoto/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf200b6f/uploads/origins/c98a470b-a146-4e6e-9db5-f794e15b8a2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7fccb174089bb4b932e561eaac2dbc3a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf200b6f/uploads/origins/c98a470b-a146-4e6e-9db5-f794e15b8a2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7fccb174089bb4b932e561eaac2dbc3a, https://si.imgix.net/bf200b6f/uploads/origins/c98a470b-a146-4e6e-9db5-f794e15b8a2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6ae81597460fb91d9bf23f7391ecf5fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf200b6f/uploads/origins/c98a470b-a146-4e6e-9db5-f794e15b8a2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a37e2689604c5d05dc9deca0e5d77b9c 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2431125, "nc": 129}, {"path": "/@tkskmakoto/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2431125, "client_id": 1242278, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=30e4e5c2fb752047c1b7b89b5d196c09", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=30e4e5c2fb752047c1b7b89b5d196c09, https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26073a7ff8f83a9e86ea9e65aa33f2a1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9685593994eef257306827d60390c659 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=88cdbf0baa6276882b68cdee35b1d1db", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=88cdbf0baa6276882b68cdee35b1d1db, https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f9598b98dca112c99cad77ea03651037 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cb33585b/uploads/origins/049a5c48-26f1-47ea-8bdc-98e76ba6cd74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b802752518b1ce467cc808741857806d 3x"}, "body": "Twitterでの絵が素晴らしいですね。もしリクエストを受け付けているのであれば、私のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？\n\n優しくて、好奇心旺盛で、明るくて、真面目で、ちょっと衝動的で、遊び好きで、よく物思いにふけったりします。普段はおてんばな感じですが、きれいなお洋服を着るのが好きです。\n\n最近、twitterで描いている衣装がすごいんです。スタイル抜群の水着も、日常的な現代的な衣装も、どちらも超カワイイです。できれば、私のキャラに似合いそうな服を描いていただきたいです。\nでも、「服を考えるのはちょっと......」という方でもOKです。参考文献の中から一番気になる服を選んでいただいて結構です。\n\n私のキャラクターは、PSDの中で別のレイヤーになっているとありがたいのですが。プロフィール写真などの用途で、背景のないバージョンを入手できるようにするためです。また、サインも別レイヤーにしていただけるとありがたいです。\n\n私のリクエストを考慮していただき、ありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1HdxysbTza1ML9NZZkX0DSmU4swID-XZM", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 5787, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "𝘂𝗻𝗶🐠", "screen_name": "mer_unipi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2062195401428795392/wtm_aT10.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2467742767/1693839720/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 771844, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "さつま芋辺", "screen_name": "imo_be", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1816071856254009344/H5lxpAC-.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/781831139702956034/1721821065/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genr